{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for StudySync', 'description': 'Primary container for StudySync implementation: Exam Countdown is a responsive web app for students to track upcoming exams and study milestones. Built with React/Next.js, Supabase handles authentication and secure storage of user-specific exam and milestone data. Students can add exams, view countdowns with urgency color-coding, manage study milestones, log grades and reflections, sort exams, toggle light/dark mode, and optionally export to calendar. The UI is clean, mobile-friendly, and optimized for student productivity.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "User Authentication",\n      "description": "Students can sign up and log in securely using Supabase Authentication.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Exam Management",\n      "description": "Add, view, and manage upcoming exams with fields for title, subject, and date. Exams are linked to the user\'s account and stored in Supabase.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Countdown Display",\n      "description": "Dashboard shows a countdown in days for each exam, color-coded by urgency: green (>10 days), yellow (5\\u201310 days), red (<5 days).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Study Milestones",\n      "description": "Users can add milestones for each exam, with title, target date, and status (pending/done), stored in a separate milestones table.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Grade Logging & Reflection",\n      "description": "After an exam date passes, users can log their grade and write reflection notes for future review.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Sorting & Filtering",\n      "description": "Sort exams by date or subject for easier organization.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Light/Dark Mode",\n      "description": "Toggle between light and dark UI themes for comfort.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Export to Calendar",\n      "description": "Optionally export exams and milestones to a calendar format (e.g., .ics).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Mobile-Friendly UI",\n      "description": "Responsive design ensures usability on mobile devices.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2563eb",\n    "secondary": "#f1f5f9",\n    "accent": "#f59e42"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The main dashboard displays a list of upcoming exams as cards, each showing the exam title, subject, date, and a color-coded countdown. Each exam card can expand to show associated milestones and allow grade/reflection entry after the exam date. A top navigation bar includes sorting options, light/dark mode toggle, and export button. The layout is clean, uses Tailwind CSS for styling, and adapts to mobile screens with collapsible menus and touch-friendly controls."\n}'}",
